    "result_text": "All green \u2014 `BUILD SUCCESS`, 1 test passing. The audit log confirms the new format: `memberId=NSW2716E6609E1` (region `NSW` + FY `27` for the Aug-2026 \u2192 FY2027 registration + `16E6609E` HASH8 + Luhn `1`).\n\n## Summary\n\nI unified `customerCode` and `membershipNumber` into a single `memberId` formatted `<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>`, and removed the standalone `checkDigit` field.\n\n**Schema / API contract**\n- `openapi.yml`: replaced the `customerCode`, `checkDigit`, and `membershipNumber` schema blocks with one `memberId` block; updated the `locality` and `fiscalYear` descriptions to reference the memberId. The DTO (`OwnerDto`) is regenerated from this at build time.\n- `db/{h2,hsqldb,mysql,postgres}/schema.sql`: renamed column `customer_code` \u2192 `member_id` (widened to `VARCHAR(32)` to hold the longer id plus any collision suffix).\n\n**Domain**\n- `Owner.java`: field/column `customerCode`/`customer_code` \u2192 `memberId`/`member_id`, with `get/setMemberId`.\n\n**Identifier construction (`OwnerRestControllerV1`)**\n- New `memberId(postcode, telephone, lastName, registrationDate)` builds `REGION` (from postcode) + 2-digit `FY` (fiscal year of the business-day-adjusted registration date) + `HASH8` (first 8 upper-hex of SHA-256 over `telephone+lastName`, the same value the region-and-hash identity uses) + `CHK` (Luhn over the digits of `REGION+FY+HASH8`, reusing `CheckDigitDeriver`).\n- Renamed `deduplicateCustomerCode` \u2192 `deduplicateMemberId` \u2014 **collision handling now applies to the memberId**.\n- `primaryIdentifier` and the structured/text **audit records now reference `memberId`**.\n\n**Derivations (mappers)**\n- `LocalityDeriver.locality(...)` now reads the `<REGION>` prefix out of the memberId (known-prefix match, `UNKNOWN` otherwise). `locality`, `timezone`, and **`ownerSegment` all reference the memberId**.\n- `FiscalYearDeriver.fiscalYearLabel(String memberId)` reads the `FY` segment from the memberId (replacing the old `LocalDate` overload); **`fiscalYear` now references the memberId**.\n- `OwnerMapper`: dropped the `checkDigit`/`membershipNumber` mappings; `memberId` auto-maps; `fiscalYear`/`locality`/`timezone`/`ownerSegment` expressions rewired to `owner.getMemberId()`.\n- `CheckDigitDeriver` kept as the generic Luhn helper (its digit is now the CHK segment); javadoc updated accordingly.",
